Thanks to lm_sensors, i managed to program for fan speed silence and 
efficiency on asus w1n.
Let's not talk about all the programs on windows (speedfan and power4gear) 
that are blocking each other and freezing everything without controlling the 
fan speed correctly. Anyway i chose to use linux. And battery length is 
clearly increasing since i use lm_sensors with a little c program to adapt 
fan speed to the temperatures of cpu, gpu and mobo.
I have put with this message that little 100 lines program and a little readme 
(in french, sorry didn't have time to translate...).
So, thank you again for this very good lm_sensors project !!!

